The examples in this directory are described in the userguide.

Short description
-----------------

grid_deformation1

 Grid deformation: elements are "attracted" towards a circle.

grid_deformation2

 Grid deformation for where the elements are "attracted" towards a sphere.

grid_deformation3

 Grid deformation: the elements are "attracted" towards a circle.
 Periodical boundary conditions in x-direction  

grid_deformation4

 Grid deformation for where the elements are "attracted" towards a sphere.
 Periodical boundary conditions in x-direction

grid_deformation5

 Grid deformation: elements are "attracted" towards two circles.

grid_deformation6

 Stokes problem on a unit square with Dirichlet boundary conditions.
 Lid-driven cavity flow.
 One freely moving and rotating object. Time-stepping.
 Grid deformation.
 This problem is similar to example stokes8, but now with grid deformation.
